      "VIII. OPERATIONAL CHECKLIST",
      "- [ ] Each Action maps to ≥1 Result",
      "- [ ] Results include at least one numeric delta",
      "- [ ] Baseline captured for causal contrast",
      "- [ ] Competencies align with target job",
      "- [ ] Evidence links are accessible",

      "",
